===Etymology===
From earlier *{{m|sh||pěsma}}, by assimilation p-n → p-m from {{der|sh|sla-pro|*pěsnь}}. The original stem has been preserved in archaic {{m|sh|pjȅsan}} as well as old derivations such as {{m|sh|пје̏снӣк}}/{{m|sh|пе̏снӣк}}.

